CopyArrivalDate yes

IMAPAccount gmail
Host imap.gmail.com
Port 993
User
Pass
TLSType IMAPS
TLSVersions +1.3
AuthMechs PLAIN LOGIN
# Disabled. Enable to bust GMail quota limit.
# PipelineDepth 50

IMAPStore gmail-remote
Account gmail

MaildirStore gmail-local
SubFolders Verbatim
Path ~/Mail/gmail/
Inbox ~/Mail/gmail/INBOX

Channel gmail-inbox
Far :gmail-remote:
Near :gmail-local:
Patterns INBOX
Sync All
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *

Channel gmail-sent
Far :gmail-remote:"[Gmail]/Sent Mail"
Near :gmail-local:"[Gmail]/Sent Mail"
Sync All
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *

Channel gmail-drafts
Far :gmail-remote:"[Gmail]/Drafts"
Near :gmail-local:"[Gmail]/Drafts"
Sync All
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *

Channel gmail-starred
Far :gmail-remote:"[Gmail]/Starred"
Near :gmail-local:"[Gmail]/Starred"
Sync All
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *

Channel gmail-bin
Far :gmail-remote:"[Gmail]/Bin"
Near :gmail-local:"[Gmail]/Bin"
Sync All
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *

Channel gmail-spam
Far :gmail-remote:"[Gmail]/Spam"
Near :gmail-local:"[Gmail]/Spam"
Sync All
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *


Channel gmail-linux-pci
Far :gmail-remote:"Linux PCI"
Near :gmail-local:"Linux PCI"
Sync All
Create Near
Expunge Near
SyncState *

Group gmail
Channel gmail-inbox
Channel gmail-sent
Channel gmail-drafts
Channel gmail-starred
Channel gmail-bin
Channel gmail-spam
Channel gmail-linux-pci
